    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Accept crypto on Easy Digital Downloads with 0.1% fee</p>\n<p>Zeno Crypto Checkout for Easy Digital Downloads lets your store receive crypto and Binance Pay payments directly through <strong>on-chain transactions</strong></p>\n<p>See exactly what your customers will experience at checkout:<br />\n<a href=\"https://pay.zenobank.io/demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Try the checkout demo</a></p>\n<p>Questions? Check the <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/#faqs\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a><br />\nOr reach out through <a href=\"https://t.me/zenobank\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Telegram</a></p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin sends order data (amount, currency) to api.zenobank.io to process crypto payments.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zenobank.io/terms\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Service</a> | <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install via the <strong>WordPress Plugin Installer</strong> or upload manually.  </li>\n<li>Activate the plugin under <strong>Plugins <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Installed Plugins</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Go to <a href=\"https://dashboard.zenobank.io/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">dashboard.zenobank.io</a> and create your account.  </li>\n<li>Add a wallet address (this is where you will receive funds).  </li>\n<li>In your dashboard, go to <strong>Integrations <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Easy Digital Download</strong>, and click <strong>Connect</strong>.  </li>\n<li>Copy the generated <strong>API key</strong>.  </li>\n<li>In your EDD store, open the <strong>Downloads -&gt; Settings -&gt; Payments -&gt; Zeno</strong> settings and paste the API key.  </li>\n<li>Save changes, enable the gateway, and start accepting crypto payments.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Accept crypto on Easy Digital Downloads with 0.1% fee",
    "description": "<p>Accept crypto on Easy Digital Downloads with 0.1% fee</p>\n<p>Zeno Crypto Checkout for Easy Digital Downloads lets your store receive crypto and Binance Pay payments directly through <strong>on-chain transactions</strong></p>\n<p>See exactly what your customers will experience at checkout:<br />\n<a href=\"https://pay.zenobank.io/demo\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Try the checkout demo</a></p>\n<p>Questions? Check the <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/#faqs\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">FAQs</a><br />\nOr reach out through <a href=\"https://t.me/zenobank\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Telegram</a></p>\n<h3>External services</h3>\n<p>This plugin sends order data (amount, currency) to api.zenobank.io to process crypto payments.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://zenobank.io/terms\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Terms of Service</a> | <a href=\"https://zenobank.io/privacy\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Privacy Policy</a></p>\n",
